.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-startup 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-startup \- Report whether this container matches what the repository declares
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten startup\fR [\fB\-\-repair\fR] [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report whether this container matches what the repository declares
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-repair\fR
Run each failing row\*(Aqs declared repair, then re\-decide its check
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
